{"id":"633137","name":"野苋菜肉馄饨","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633137/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"野苋菜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"肉糜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"馄饨皮","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"若干"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"苋菜洗净。","img":"images/633137/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"焯水。","img":"images/633137/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮开锅捞出过冷水，攥干水分。","img":"images/633137/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/633137/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取肉糜。","img":"images/633137/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"葱姜切末。","img":"images/633137/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"肉糜里放葱姜末，放食用油、食盐、鸡精和生抽。","img":"images/633137/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/633137/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放野菜拌匀。","img":"images/633137/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取馄饨皮。","img":"images/633137/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"包馄饨。","img":"images/633137/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"全部包完。","img":"images/633137/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅烧开水。","img":"images/633137/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"下馄饨。","img":"images/633137/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"煮馄饨的时候，洗净香菜切末，放碗里，放虾皮和食盐鸡精。","img":"images/633137/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放陈醋。","img":"images/633137/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放香油。","img":"images/633137/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"馄饨煮熟。","img":"images/633137/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"盛放在香菜碗里，拌匀即可。","img":"images/633137/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}